      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we're heading into the Nebula board meeting soon. We need to lock in that $1.2B valuation or the whole merger is dead in the water. When they ask about the strength and current status of our IP portfolio, specifically our data processing patents, how should we be characterizing them to ensure they don't push the price down?",
