      "content": "That sounds okay, but I'm worried. Nebula's legal team is sharp—they're going to dig into the specifics. They might ask about any pending litigation or challenges to our core patents. If they start poking around the data processing side, how do we handle that without them getting spooked and lowering the offer? We can't afford for them to realize there's any instability there.",
